"""Russian UI labels for Solo Realms, taken from the project glossary.

The labels are NOT an official translation: each one is a term the project
verified against the Russian PHB 2024 / GM 2024 text, with the page it was
found on. ``LABELS`` maps an English term to its Russian wording;
``PAGES`` keeps the provenance so a caller can cite the source instead of
trusting the string. Four entries are deliberately ABSENT from the source
text (``legendary_actions``, ``lair_actions``, ``innate_spellcasting``, and the
proficiency-bonus shorthand); they are omitted rather than invented.

Identity is never translated: slugs, item ids and counter keys stay ASCII,
because the host stores them in state and a translated key would break every
round trip. Only the human-facing label goes through this table.
"""

